{"id":274,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自学自習と自治自律で個性を磨く成城学園","feature_description":"成城学園は「自学自習」と「自治自律」の精神を大切にし、質の高い学び、多様な体験、心身の鍛錬を通して個性を磨く力を育てます。生徒が自ら学習課題を見つけ、克服に向けて取り組む主体的な学習者を目指し、授業・行事・部活動を通じて互いの個性を尊重する姿勢を養います。分野を超えて学び、応用力や課題解決力を培う教育を掲げています。理念を授業と学校生活につなげています。","clubs":[{"id":4082,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4083,"name":"女子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4084,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4085,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4086,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4087,"name":"男子テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4088,"name":"女子テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4089,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4090,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4095,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4096,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4097,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seijogakuen.ed.jp/chukou/school-life/clubs/","verified